{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "action" %}
{# DeD FHU inflation — body-state facts. INFORMATIVE ONLY, never directive.
   Tier-0 (nothing in the noticeable band) renders NOTHING. Windowed
   (the 0171 precedent sized for a long-lived state): prompt_show opens
   ~1 min per 10 min of banded time, and a fresh episode (unanchored by
   the 10s poll yet) reads as inside an open window, so state updates
   land without repetition. Brace-balanced.

   REV-157 (2026-10-24) — the 0175 mold applied to FHU. Lane conventions
   transcribed exactly: the bio lane's actor variable is actorUUID (0171
   precedent); every numeric read is guarded (default() + isNumber) so no
   comparison can see null/undefined; present false renders nothing.
   NULL CONTRACT (psc side, REV-157): get_ded_inflation always returns
   well-formed JSON — {"present": false} under every absent-framework
   state; freshness_s is always an Int >= 0; prompt_show is always 0 or
   1; band is always "noticeable" or "heavy"; the band floors default to
   the MCM sliders (30%/60%) with safe fallbacks when the host is absent.
   The self/other split: the SELF branch renders the subject's own
   swelling; the OTHER branch renders the nearest in-band inflated actor
   in the subject's cell. Branch texts below are STRATEGIST DRAFT
   (register entry 36) — the user's ruling gates INSTALL; first enabled
   render IS the probe (clean = LIVE; error box = escalate). #}
{% if actorUUID and actorUUID != 0 %}
{% set inf = get_ded_inflation(actorUUID) %}
{% if inf and inf.present %}
{% set show = default(inf.prompt_show, 1) %}
{% if not isNumber(show) %}
{% set show = 1 %}
{% endif %}
{% set fr = default(inf.freshness_s, 0) %}
{% if not isNumber(fr) %}
{% set fr = 0 %}
{% endif %}
{% if show == 1 %}
{% if inf.self %}
## Your Body
{% if inf.band == "heavy" %}
{% if fr < 600 %}
Your belly is hugely distended and still swelling — the heavy, taut roundness of it strains with every breath.
{% else %}
Your belly remains hugely distended — the heavy swell has settled in and refuses to go down.
{% endif %}
{% else %}
{% if fr < 600 %}
Your belly is noticeably swollen and still filling — a warm, weighted fullness you can feel with every step.
{% else %}
Your belly stays noticeably swollen — the lingering fullness has not gone down.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
## Who Is Nearby
{{ default(inf.name, "The swollen person") }} {% if inf.band == "heavy" %}is hugely distended, belly heavy and taut with the swelling{% else %}has a noticeably swollen belly{% endif %}{% if fr < 600 %}, and it is still filling{% else %}, the swelling long since settled in{% endif %}.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
